replies.body:
Good question! I provide dimensions, control points, and placement coordinates, not every final vertex. The tank is a parametric construction program that Three.js executes.

For example, conceptually:

    P.add('hull', box(width, height, length), x, y, z, rotX, rotY, rotZ);

    buildRunningGear(P, {
      wheelR: 0.25,
      wheelZs: [2.10, 1.35, 0.59, -0.16, -0.91, -1.67, -2.42],
      sprocket: { z: -3.0, y: 0.86, r: 0.24 },
    });
